# Test hoi thoai nhieu luot - thay {{conversationId}} bang ma nhan duoc o luot dau

### Bat dau phien moi
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat/new

### Kich ban 1 - Luot 1: chao va cung cap danh tinh
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Chao phong kham, toi ten Nam, so dien thoai 0901234567

### Kich ban 1 - Luot 2: hoi bac si chinh nha
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Phong kham co bac si chinh nha nao?&conversationId={{conversationId}}

### Kich ban 1 - Luot 3: hoi gia dich vu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Nieng rang gia bao nhieu?&conversationId={{conversationId}}

### Kich ban 1 - Luot 4: dat lich, chatbot tu dung ten va sdt da biet
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Dat cho toi lich tu van nieng rang voi bac si do, ngay 2026-08-25 luc 10:00&conversationId={{conversationId}}

### Kich ban 2 - Luot 1: yeu cau thieu thong tin, chatbot phai hoi lai
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Toi muon dat lich kham

### Kich ban 2 - Luot tiep: bo sung tung phan thong tin theo cau hoi cua chatbot
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Toi ten Lan, so dien thoai 0912345678&conversationId={{conversationId}}

### Kich ban 3 - Luot 1: dat vao gio da kin (09:00 ngay 2026-08-20 cua bac si Nguyen Thi Mai da co lich mau)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Toi ten Hung, sdt 0987654321, dat lich Kham tong quat voi bac si Nguyen Thi Mai ngay 2026-08-20 luc 09:00

### Kich ban 3 - Luot 2: doi sang gio trong theo goi y
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Vay cho toi 10:00 cung ngay&conversationId={{conversationId}}

### Kich ban 3 - Luot 3: doi lich vua dat
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Doi lich vua dat sang 2026-08-26 luc 14:00 giup toi&conversationId={{conversationId}}

### Kich ban 3 - Luot 4: huy lich
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chat?message=Thoi, huy lich do giup toi&conversationId={{conversationId}}
